      "title": "File:'Pakhuis Santos' Brede Hilledijk Rotterdam (6952128631).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2b/%27Pakhuis_Santos%27_Brede_Hilledijk_Rotterdam_%286952128631%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%27Pakhuis_Santos%27_Brede_Hilledijk_Rotterdam_(6952128631).jpg",
